 the co-op version of the demo, coming very soon to Steam, message us! We'd love to invite you to play online with our team, or to join our beta on Steam.A huge thank you to everyone who has played the demo, shared feedback and supported us a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:11:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692916","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1846651706674981","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"V0.3.2 of Bunny Flags is up on steam.","summary":"Hey everyone! There is a new version 0.3.2 of Bunny Flags is up on steam! small udate but with one BIG CHANGE!! Here it goes!!: 1. Video settings: modify screen resolution and windows mode. 2. Fixed minor bugs. 3. MAYOR UPDATE: New start level rules: you no longer start with a flag and the game will wait for your input before you start. Please, play it and let us know what you think and we really hope you enjoy it!! :D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:55:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674981","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1843481262703380","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Access to the settings from the Pause Menu","summary":"Hey Bunnies! We just pushed a small update to the Bunny Flags demo where we fixed several bugs that players have been reporting since our last major playable version. The most important change is that you can now open Settings directly from the pause menu. From there you can:Remap keyboard and controller controlsChange audio optionsSwitch the game languageIt’s a short update, but an important one thanks to the feedback you’ve been sending us. Hope the game feels better to play. Let us know what ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T02:02:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703380","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1842846814439113","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"It's Time for a New Roguelite Fight!","summary":"The community asked for runs with more identity, a different pace, and higher replayability, but what you also wanted was for us to bring back the enemies that made our beloved trilogy iconic. Version 0.3.0 answers all your requests, and it does so with a question now echoing through every room in the game: are you ready to fight the Handies?Slime, Footballer, and Helmet each fight their own way, patrol the map, and actually telegraph their attacks, so you'll see trouble coming before it hits. L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T02:51:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1841579228670676","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Racabat!","summary":"Hey Soldiers!After a long wait, it’s finally time to meet your number one enemy: RACABAT!This greedy raccoon is the one who started it all. Not only did he want every last piece of Bunny land for himself, but he also vowed to wipe every bunny from the face of the Earth — claiming there simply wasn’t enough room for both Bunnies and Raccoons.Something tells us he is just jealous of how amazing Bunnies really are… and now it’s our turn to show him exactly how wrong he was for kicking us off our la","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T03:25:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1840310314348137","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW Version of Demo 0.2.0 is here!","summary":"You spoke and we listened!We took all your feedback to heart. Thanks to you, we’re rolling out fixes and design updates to make Bunny Flags the best experience it can be.This new demo is more than just an update, it’s the official new version of the Bunny Flags Demo, were the whole experience is finally full roguelite and procedural, with more variety in the scenery and stronger capture-the-flag gameplay.Here’s everything new in build 0.2.0:Dynamic time of day: Every run changes: night, noon, su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T20:03:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1839676055886406","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1.6: Bunny Flags Now in 5 New Languages!","summary":"Hey soldiers!We just released version 0.1.6 with brand new localizations! Our goal is for everyone to enjoy the demo, so now you can play Bunny Flags in Spanish, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, and German!Need to switch languages? Right-click Bunny Flags Demo in your Steam Library → Properties → General → Language, and pick the one you want. Let us know what you think, especially if there's a better way to say something in your language. We want this to feel right for everyone playing.See","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T21:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1839041357037109","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bug Fixes & Your Feedback!","summary":"Our demo is up and running!!! These past few days have been about fixing major bugs and listening to feedback on how to improve the gameplay experience. If you've already downloaded the demo and haven't played it yet, or plan to play it soon, please make sure you have the updated version.The feedback we've received directly from players has been amazing, and even though this is our first game on Steam, we're giving it our full attention to make sure every detail is right.Another important update","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T01:32:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1837955055364661","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"Ronny Antares Is Back with the Score of Bunny Flags!!","summary":"Did you know that the first Bunny Charms game had no music, just gunfire and a handful of sound effects, which was pretty normal for web games back in 2009? That changed in early 2011, when Bunny Charms made its return as Bunny Flags and shifted from a shooter to a tower defense game. Chilean composer Ronny Antares came on board and gave it its first real score, one that's still doing its job today: building tension right before every battle. And here's the best part, that same score has since b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T23:18:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4442780-1837955055360477","game_id":"steam-4442780","kind":"announcement","title":"The Bunny Flags Demo Is Coming Soon!!","summary":"We're excited to share that the Bunny Flags demo is on its way!! Between 2009 and 2013, we launched a web game trilogy in the tower defense and top-down shooter genres, named Bunny Charms and then Bunny Flags I and II, where our players lived out our chaotic vision of what happens when a bunny gets tired of giant fingers poking at him.With this demo, we wanted to bring a fresh Roguelite energy to that world, keeping what fans loved while building something new to play, now under the ultimate ret","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T04:14:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4442780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4442780":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4442780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z"},"4788660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:48Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4442780","app_id":4442780,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"ko